px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.miyoushe.com/upload/2024/06/04/75276539/27fb0dd8404796a1f14e85cf26b17da7_6301936752349856526.png?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\\\"\u003e〓活动奖励〓\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://upload-bbs.miyoushe.com/upload/2024/06/04/75276539/1222896e5c38bede8e322d3e322e1657_8202587665556786535.png?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.miyoushe.com/upload/2024/06/04/75276539/1222896e5c38bede8e322d3e322e1657_8202587665556786535.png?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\\\"\u003e〓参与条件〓\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(173, 114, 14)\\\"\u003e冒险等阶≥20级\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(173, 114, 14)\\\"\u003e且完成魔神任务：序章·第三幕「巨龙与自由之歌」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\\\"\u003e※完成魔神任务：第四章·第五幕「罪人舞步旋」后参与活动体验更佳。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\\\"\u003e〓活动说明〓\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e● 活动期间，「进攻想定」与「防御想定」两种关卡将陆续解锁。旅行者需要考察想定目标，分析敌方阵容，选择兵棋组成己方阵容，进行挑战。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e● \u003c/span\u003e在想定关卡中选中交战单位或阵线建筑后，可以将其部署在指定区域，交战单位被部署后，将自动进行战斗，期间旅行者可以使用领队战技，为自己的队伍创造有利条件。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e● 完成各个关卡的挑战后，可获得「分析进度」。累积「分析进度」可获得\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(173, 114, 14)\\\"\u003e「弓·筑云」、原石、智识之冕、活动专属武器精炼材料\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e等奖励。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1312","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"流程","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/06/11/4521515/2810c71d33ef54b1ba88196a47dfed18_4709527674785862451.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"648\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 648px\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/06/11/4521515/2810c71d33ef54b1ba88196a47dfed18_4709527674785862451.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 648px\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/06/11/4521515/6ce416146220eb6a0a219